{"title":"为什么造价工程师一定要分专业？","date":"2026-07-14","content":"<h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span class=\"js_title_inner\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px;\">为什么造价工程师一定要分专业？</span></h1>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"71609\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"height: 1px; padding: 1px 6px 0px; z-index: 1; display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset; transform: rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top:-13px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(216, 38, 6); letter-spacing: 4px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);padding:20px 15px;width:100%;margin-top:-12px;background-color:rgb(250, 250, 250);box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">很多刚入行的人都有个疑问：</span></p>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">都是算钱，为什么造价工程师还要分土建、安装、水利、交通？</span></p>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">听起来，好像都是&ldquo;算工程量、套定额、做清单&rdquo;，差别能有多大？</span></p>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">但真正干过项目的人都知道&mdash;&mdash;差别不是大，是非常大。</span></p>\r\n\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">说白了，造价这个行业，看起来都是&ldquo;算&rdquo;，其实算的根本不是同一种东西。</span></p>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"71515\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section class=\"_li\" style=\"margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-top:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-right:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-left:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-image:initial;margin:0px 8px;background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);height:8px;border-bottom:none;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-radius:35px;padding:1px 15px;margin:-3px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:34px;height:34px;line-height:30px;border:2px solid rgb(254, 254, 254);color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(255, 170, 0);border-radius:7px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0px;z-index:1;margin:-26px 0px 0px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotate(45deg);-webkit-transform:rotate(45deg);-moz-transform:rotate(45deg);-ms-transform:rotate(45deg);-o-transform:rotate(45deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size:17px;transform:rotate(-45deg);-webkit-transform:rotate(-45deg);-moz-transform:rotate(-45deg);-ms-transform:rotate(-45deg);-o-transform:rotate(-45deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong class=\"_num\" data-form=\"0\" data-num=\"1\">01</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex:1 1 0%;text-align:right;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<em><strong>工程长得不一样，计价逻辑就不一样</strong></em></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-right:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-bottom:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-left:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-image:initial;margin:0px 8px;background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);height:8px;border-top:none;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);padding:15px;margin-left:15px;margin-top:15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">你去看一个房建项目，核心是钢筋、混凝土、模板。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">你再去看一个公路项目，重点变成路基、路面、桥梁、边坡。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">再去看水利项目，可能是土石坝、溢洪道、隧洞、灌浆、防渗墙。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">表面上都是工程。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">但背后的施工逻辑完全不同。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">比如：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">同样是&ldquo;土方开挖&rdquo;。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">房建可能关注基坑支护；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">公路关注路基填挖平衡；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">水利关注弃渣、导流、边坡稳定。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">看起来只是名字一样，实际干法完全不是一回事。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">而造价，本质上是对施工过程的货币化表达。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">施工逻辑不同，价格逻辑自然也不同。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 2;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"_li\" style=\"margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-top:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-right:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-left:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-image:initial;margin:0px 8px;background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);height:8px;border-bottom:none;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-radius:35px;padding:1px 15px;margin:-3px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:34px;height:34px;line-height:30px;border:2px solid rgb(254, 254, 254);color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(255, 170, 0);border-radius:7px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0px;z-index:1;margin:-26px 0px 0px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotate(45deg);-webkit-transform:rotate(45deg);-moz-transform:rotate(45deg);-ms-transform:rotate(45deg);-o-transform:rotate(45deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size:17px;transform:rotate(-45deg);-webkit-transform:rotate(-45deg);-moz-transform:rotate(-45deg);-ms-transform:rotate(-45deg);-o-transform:rotate(-45deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong class=\"_num\" data-form=\"0\" data-num=\"1\">02</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex:1 1 0%;text-align:right;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<em><strong>同一个工程量，在不同专业里算法都可能不一样</strong></em></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-right:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-bottom:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-left:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-image:initial;margin:0px 8px;background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);height:8px;border-top:none;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);padding:15px;margin-left:15px;margin-top:15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">这是很多新人最容易踩坑的地方。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">举个简单例子：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">混凝土。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">在土建里，你可能按实体体积算；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">在水利里，可能涉及不同强度等级、不同浇筑部位、温控措施；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">在交通里，又可能牵扯桥梁现浇、预制、运输、吊装。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">再比如模板：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">有的按接触面积算；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">有的按展开面积算；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">有的甚至部分内容已经综合进子目。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">如果你不懂专业规则，只会机械套定额，很容易算错。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">而造价行业里，最值钱的从来不是&ldquo;会套&rdquo;，而是知道为什么这么套。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 2;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"_li\" style=\"margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-top:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-right:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-left:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-image:initial;margin:0px 8px;background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);height:8px;border-bottom:none;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-radius:35px;padding:1px 15px;margin:-3px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:34px;height:34px;line-height:30px;border:2px solid rgb(254, 254, 254);color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(255, 170, 0);border-radius:7px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0px;z-index:1;margin:-26px 0px 0px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotate(45deg);-webkit-transform:rotate(45deg);-moz-transform:rotate(45deg);-ms-transform:rotate(45deg);-o-transform:rotate(45deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size:17px;transform:rotate(-45deg);-webkit-transform:rotate(-45deg);-moz-transform:rotate(-45deg);-ms-transform:rotate(-45deg);-o-transform:rotate(-45deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong class=\"_num\" data-form=\"0\" data-num=\"1\">03</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex:1 1 0%;text-align:right;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<em><strong>经验不能通用，这是造价最残酷的地方</strong></em></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-right:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-bottom:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-left:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-image:initial;margin:0px 8px;background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);height:8px;border-top:none;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);padding:15px;margin-left:15px;margin-top:15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">很多人以为：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">&ldquo;我干了十年造价，什么项目都能接。&rdquo;</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">现实往往不是这样。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">一个做了十年水利的人，可能对围堰、导流、帷幕灌浆特别熟。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">但让他去做机电安装，消防联动系统怎么计价，他可能一脸懵。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">反过来也一样。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">因为造价经验不是通用技能，而是专业积累。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">你熟悉的是：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">工序逻辑</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">风险点</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">容易漏项的地方</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">审计喜欢卡的地方</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">定额容易争议的地方</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">这些东西，全是靠一个个项目喂出来的。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">换专业，相当于半路重练。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 2;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"_li\" style=\"margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-top:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-right:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-left:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-image:initial;margin:0px 8px;background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);height:8px;border-bottom:none;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-radius:35px;padding:1px 15px;margin:-3px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:34px;height:34px;line-height:30px;border:2px solid rgb(254, 254, 254);color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(255, 170, 0);border-radius:7px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0px;z-index:1;margin:-26px 0px 0px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotate(45deg);-webkit-transform:rotate(45deg);-moz-transform:rotate(45deg);-ms-transform:rotate(45deg);-o-transform:rotate(45deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size:17px;transform:rotate(-45deg);-webkit-transform:rotate(-45deg);-moz-transform:rotate(-45deg);-ms-transform:rotate(-45deg);-o-transform:rotate(-45deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong class=\"_num\" data-form=\"0\" data-num=\"1\">04</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex:1 1 0%;text-align:right;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<em><strong>国家分专业，本质上也是提高行业门槛</strong></em></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-right:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-bottom:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-left:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-image:initial;margin:0px 8px;background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);height:8px;border-top:none;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);padding:15px;margin-left:15px;margin-top:15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">现在一级造价工程师分：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">土木建筑</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">安装工程</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">交通运输</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">水利工程</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">这不是故意搞复杂。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">而是因为每个专业背后，都有一整套独立的计价体系。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">比如：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">水利有自己的概算定额；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">交通有公路工程估概预算体系；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">房建、市政更多用清单计价体系。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">规则不同，监管方式也不同。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">分专业，既方便管理，也能防止&ldquo;什么都敢签&rdquo;的情况出现。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">否则，一个只做房建的人去签大型水库概算，风险太大。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 2;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"_li\" style=\"margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-top:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-right:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-left:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-image:initial;margin:0px 8px;background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);height:8px;border-bottom:none;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-radius:35px;padding:1px 15px;margin:-3px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:34px;height:34px;line-height:30px;border:2px solid rgb(254, 254, 254);color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(255, 170, 0);border-radius:7px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0px;z-index:1;margin:-26px 0px 0px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotate(45deg);-webkit-transform:rotate(45deg);-moz-transform:rotate(45deg);-ms-transform:rotate(45deg);-o-transform:rotate(45deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size:17px;transform:rotate(-45deg);-webkit-transform:rotate(-45deg);-moz-transform:rotate(-45deg);-ms-transform:rotate(-45deg);-o-transform:rotate(-45deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong class=\"_num\" data-form=\"0\" data-num=\"1\">05</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex:1 1 0%;text-align:right;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<em><strong>未来分专业只会越来越细</strong></em></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-right:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-bottom:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-left:2px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);border-image:initial;margin:0px 8px;background-color:rgb(254, 254, 254);height:8px;border-top:none;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(255, 170, 0);padding:15px;margin-left:15px;margin-top:15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">很多造价人以为拿到证就结束了。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">其实只是开始。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">未来市场化改革越来越深，定额约束越来越弱，真正决定你价值的，不是证书，而是专业深度。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">你会发现：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">懂土建的人很多；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">但懂超限高层的少。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">懂水利的人不少；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">但懂抽蓄、泵站、大型隧洞的少。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">行业越往后走，越拼细分。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">最后留下来的，往往不是&ldquo;全都会&rdquo;的人，而是某个领域特别深的人。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 2;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">所以，造价工程师为什么要分专业？</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">因为工程本来就不是一个世界。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">你以为都是在算钱，其实每个专业算的，都是完全不同的逻辑。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">造价这行，真正拉开差距的，从来不是会不会套定额，而是你懂不懂工程。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">懂工程的人，才有资格把钱算明白。</span></p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>"}